    - target: {fileID: 6872953807347953618, guid: 4386d01b551da4f698264a58afb9317f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'hello Johann here, 3 things I wanna mention abt inventory items


        1.
        There is now a "deselect" option, if you toggle the inventory open or close,
        that counts as you choosing to select an item (open) or choosing to not use
        an item at all (close)


        2. ERROR: Items have to be keyed (1-5) THEN
        clicked on the UI for them to be selected, idk why


        3. Zoom-ins
        for items is still very inconsistent, just select the item again if you want
        to disable the zoom'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
